==English==

===Etymology===
{{wikipedia}}

Mistranslation of "君達の基地は、全てCATSがいただいた" (in original context: "we (CATS) have taken all of your bases").

This grammatically incorrect "[[Engrish]]" phrase originated in the English subtitles to the game ''[[w:Zero Wing|Zero Wing]]'' and became a [[catch phrase]] on the [[Internet]].

===Phrase===
{{en-phrase|[[all]] [[your]] [[base]] [[are]] [[belong]] [[to]] [[us]]}}

